Hint:Recall the series and parallel combination of capacitors.
Step 1: Find equivalent capacitance in both cases.
When the identical capacitors are connected in series then the equivalent
circuit diagram is shown below;

The equivalent capacitance of the circuit is given by;
\(C_{series} =\frac{C\times C}{C+C} =\frac{C}{2} \)
When the identical capacitors are connected in parallel then the equivalent
circuit diagram is shown below;

The equivalent capacitance of the circuit is given by;
\(C_{parallel}= C+C=2 C\)

Step 2: Find the ratio of equivalent capacitance.
The ratio of equivalent capacitance is given by;
\(\frac{C_{series}}{C_{parallel}}=\frac{1}{4}\)
Hence, option (3) is the correct answer.<div style="margin-top:1.25rem; padding:0.85rem 1rem; background:var(--bg-secondary); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px;"><div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.6rem; font-weight:600; font-size:0.88rem;"><span>📊 Student Attempt Analytics</span><span style="padding:2px 8px; border-radius:12px; font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; background:rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15); color:#16a34a;">🟢 Easy · 83% Got This Correct</span></div><div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:0.5rem; text-align:center; font-size:0.82rem;"><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(1)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">7%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(2)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">6%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:rgba(34,197,94,0.12); border:1.5px solid #22c55e;"><div style="color:#16a34a; font-weight:700;">(3) ✓</div><div style="font-weight:800; color:#16a34a; margin-top:2px;">84%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(4)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">5%</div></div></div></div>

